  "Question": "Calculate: \\(30 \\div 0.5 = ?\\) (Give your answer as a decimal.)",
  "Choices": {},
  "Correct Answer": "60",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "\\(50\\%\\) of a number is 30. Since \\(0.5=50\\%=\\frac12\\), the whole is twice 30:\n\\[\n30 \\times 2 = 60.\n\\]\nThe number is 60. Written as a decimal, the answer is \\(60.0\\).",
